    pa:relation pa:definedAs ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "in accordance with the information provided in the instructions for use" .

pa:st-0423 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:Provision_reasonably_foreseeable_misuse ;
    pa:locator "Annex III" ;
    pa:quote "(i) ‘reasonably foreseeable misuse’ means the use of machinery or a related product in a way not intended in the instructions for use, but which may result from readily predictable human behaviour." ;
    pa:relation pa:definedAs ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "the use of machinery or a related product in a way not intended in the instructions for use" .

pa:st-0424 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:locator "Annex III" ;
    pa:quote "By the iterative process of risk assessment and risk reduction referred to in the first subparagraph, the manufacturer shall:" ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "the manufacturer shall" .

pa:st-0425 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:condition "in the order of priority established in section 1.1.2(b)" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III" ;
    pa:quote "(e) eliminate the hazards or reduce the risks associated with these hazards by application of protective measures, in the order of priority established in section 1.1.2(b)." ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "eliminate the hazards or reduce the risks" .

pa:st-0427 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.2" ;
    pa:quote "(b) In selecting the most appropriate methods, the manufacturer shall apply the following principles, in the order given:" ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "shall apply the following principles, in the order given" .

pa:st-0428 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:condition "if that is not possible, minimise risks" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.2" ;
    pa:quote "(i) eliminate hazards or, if that is not possible, minimise risks (inherently safe machinery or related product design and construction);" ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "eliminate hazards" .

pa:st-0429 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:condition "in relation to risks that cannot be eliminated" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.2" ;
    pa:quote "(ii) take the necessary protective measures in relation to risks that cannot be eliminated;" ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "take the necessary protective measures" .

pa:st-0430 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:condition "due to any shortcomings of the protective measures adopted" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.2" ;
    pa:quote "(iii) inform users of the residual risks due to any shortcomings of the protective measures adopted, indicate whether any particular training is required and specify any need to provide personal protective equipment." ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "inform users of the residual risks" .

pa:st-0431 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:condition "when designing and constructing machinery or a related product and when drafting the instructions for use" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.2" ;
    pa:quote "(c) When designing and constructing machinery or a related product and when drafting the instructions for use, the manufacturer shall envisage not only the intended use of the machinery or related product but also any reasonably foreseeable misuse thereof." ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "envisage not only the intended use of the machinery or related product but also any reasonably foreseeable misuse thereof" .

pa:st-0433 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_1_3_materials_and_products ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.3" ;
    pa:quote "Materials and products The materials used to construct machinery or related products, or products used or created during its use, shall not endanger the health and safety of persons." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_endanger_the_health_and_safety_of_persons .

pa:st-0434 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_using_fluids ;
    pa:condition "where fluids are used" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.3" ;
    pa:quote "In particular, where fluids are used, machinery or related products shall be designed and constructed to prevent risks due to filling, use, recovery or draining." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_risks_due_to_filling_use_recovery_or_draining .

pa:st-0435 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_using_fluids ;
    pa:condition "where fluids are used" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.3" ;
    pa:quote "In particular, where fluids are used, machinery or related products shall be designed and constructed to prevent risks due to filling, use, recovery or draining." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_designed_and_constructed_to_prevent_risks .

pa:st-0436 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_1_4 ;
    pa:condition "where the absence thereof is likely to cause a risk despite ambient lighting of normal intensity" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.4" ;
    pa:quote "Lighting Machinery or related products shall be supplied with integral lighting suitable for the operations concerned, where the absence thereof is likely to cause a risk despite ambient lighting of normal intensity." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_integral_lighting .

pa:st-0437 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_design_essential_requirement_1_1_4 ;
    pa:condition "likely to cause nuisance" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.4" ;
    pa:quote "Machinery or related products shall be designed and constructed so that there is no area of shadow likely to cause nuisance, that there is no irritating dazzle and that there are no dangerous stroboscopic effects on moving parts due to the lighting." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_no_area_of_shadow .

pa:st-0438 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_design_essential_requirement_1_1_4 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.4" ;
    pa:quote "Machinery or related products shall be designed and constructed so that there is no area of shadow likely to cause nuisance, that there is no irritating dazzle and that there are no dangerous stroboscopic effects on moving parts due to the lighting." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_no_irritating_dazzle .

pa:st-0439 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_design_essential_requirement_1_1_4 ;
    pa:condition "on moving parts due to the lighting" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.4" ;
    pa:quote "Machinery or related products shall be designed and constructed so that there is no area of shadow likely to cause nuisance, that there is no irritating dazzle and that there are no dangerous stroboscopic effects on moving parts due to the lighting." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_no_dangerous_stroboscopic_effects .

pa:st-0440 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_internal_parts_and_maintenance_areas ;
    pa:condition "Internal parts requiring frequent inspection and adjustment, and maintenance areas" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.4" ;
    pa:quote "Internal parts requiring frequent inspection and adjustment, and maintenance areas shall be provided with appropriate lighting." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_appropriate_lighting .

pa:st-0441 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_1_5_machinery_too_heavy_to_move_by_h ;
    pa:condition "Where the weight, size or shape of machinery or a related product or its various component parts prevents it or them from being moved by hand" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.5" ;
    pa:quote "Where the weight, size or shape of machinery or a related product or its various component parts prevents it or them from being moved by hand, the machinery or related product or each component part shall: (a) either be fitted with attachments for lifting gear;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_be_fitted_with_attachments_for_lifting_gear .

pa:st-0442 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_1_5_machinery_moved_by_hand ;
    pa:condition "Where machinery or a related product or one of its component parts is to be moved by hand" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.5" ;
    pa:quote "Where machinery or a related product or one of its component parts is to be moved by hand, it shall either: (a) be easily moveable;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_be_easily_moveable .

pa:st-0443 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_1_5_machinery_moved_by_hand ;
    pa:condition "Where machinery or a related product or one of its component parts is to be moved by hand" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.5" ;
    pa:quote "Where machinery or a related product or one of its component parts is to be moved by hand, it shall either: (a) be easily moveable; or (b) be equipped for picking up and moving safely." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_be_equipped_for_picking_up_and_moving_safely .

pa:st-0444 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_1_5_tools_and_parts_that_could_be_ha ;
    pa:condition "which, even if lightweight, could be hazardous" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.5" ;
    pa:quote "Special arrangements shall be made for the handling of tools and/or machinery or related product parts, which, even if lightweight, could be hazardous." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_Special_arrangements_shall_be_made .

pa:st-0445 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_ergonomics_1_1_6 ;
    pa:condition "Under the intended conditions of use" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.6" ;
    pa:quote "Ergonomics Under the intended conditions of use, the discomfort, fatigue and physical and psychological stress faced by the operator shall be eliminated or reduced to the minimum possible, taking into account at least, the following ergonomic principles:" ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_discomfort_fatigue_and_physical_and_psychological_stress .

pa:st-0446 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_human_machine_interface ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.6" ;
    pa:quote "(f) adapting the human-machine interface to the foreseeable characteristics of the operators, including with respect to machinery or a related product with intended fully or partially self-evolving behaviour or logic that is designed to operate with varying levels of autonomy;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_adapting_the_human_machine_interface .

pa:st-0447 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_self_evolving_machinery ;
    pa:condition "where relevant" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.6" ;
    pa:quote "(g) where relevant, adapting machinery or a related product with intended fully or partially self-evolving behaviour or logic that is designed to operate with varying levels of autonomy to respond to people adequately and appropriately (such as verbally through words and non-verbally through gestures, facial expressions or body movement) and to communicate its planned actions (such as what it is going to do and why) to operators in a comprehensible manner." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_adapting_machinery_or_a_related_product .

pa:st-0448 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_operating_position_1_1_7 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.7" ;
    pa:quote "Operating positions The operating position shall be designed and constructed in such a way as to avoid any risk due to exhaust gases or lack of oxygen." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_any_risk_due_to_exhaust_gases_or_lack_of_oxygen .

pa:st-0449 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_hazardous_environment_operator_protection ;
    pa:condition "If the machinery or related product is intended to be used in a hazardous environment presenting risks to the health and safety of the operator" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.7" ;
    pa:quote "If the machinery or related product is intended to be used in a hazardous environment presenting risks to the health and safety of the operator or if the machinery or related product itself gives rise to a hazardous environment, adequate means shall be provided to ensure that the operator has good working conditions and is protected against any foreseeable hazards." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_adequate_means .

pa:st-0450 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_operating_position_cabin ;
    pa:condition "Where appropriate" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.7" ;
    pa:quote "Where appropriate, the operating position shall be fitted with an adequate cabin designed, constructed or equipped to fulfil the above requirements." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_adequate_cabin .

pa:st-0451 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_exit ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.7" ;
    pa:quote "The exit shall allow rapid evacuation." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_rapid_evacuation .

pa:st-0452 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_emergency_exit ;
    pa:condition "when applicable" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.7" ;
    pa:quote "Moreover, when applicable, an emergency exit shall be provided in a direction which is different from the usual exit." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_emergency_exit .

pa:st-0454 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_seat_provision_for_operator ;
    pa:condition "If the operator is intended to sit during operation and the operating position is an integral part of the machinery or related product" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.8" ;
    pa:quote "If the operator is intended to sit during operation and the operating position is an integral part of the machinery or related product, the seat shall be provided with the machinery or related product." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_the_seat_shall_be_provided_with_the_machinery .

pa:st-0455 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_seat_vibration_reduction ;
    pa:condition "If the machinery or related product is subject to vibrations" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.8" ;
    pa:quote "If the machinery or related product is subject to vibrations, the seat shall be designed and constructed in such a way as to reduce the vibrations transmitted to the operator to the lowest level that is reasonably possible." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_reduce_the_vibrations_transmitted_to_the_operator .

pa:st-0456 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_seat_mountings ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.8" ;
    pa:quote "The seat mountings shall withstand all stresses to which they can be subjected." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_withstand_all_stresses .

pa:st-0457 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_footrests ;
    pa:condition "Where there is no floor beneath the feet of the operator" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.8" ;
    pa:quote "Where there is no floor beneath the feet of the operator, footrests covered with a slip-resistant material shall be provided." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_footrests_covered_with_a_slip_resistant_material .

pa:st-0459 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_software_and_data_critical_for_compliance_1_1_9 ;
    pa:condition "critical for compliance with the relevant essential health and safety requirements" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.9" ;
    pa:quote "Software and data that are critical for the compliance of the machinery or related product with the relevant essential health and safety requirements shall be identified as such and shall be adequately protected against accidental or intentional corruption." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_adequately_protected_against_accidental_or_intentional_corru .

pa:st-0460 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_hardware_component_transmitting_signal_or_data_1_1_9 ;
    pa:condition "relevant for connection or access to software that is critical for compliance" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.9" ;
    pa:quote "A hardware component transmitting signal or data, relevant for connection or access to software that is critical for the compliance of the machinery or related product with the relevant essential health and safety requirements shall be designed so that it is adequately protected against accidental or intentional corruption." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_adequately_protected_against_accidental_or_intentional_corru .

pa:st-0461 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_hardware_component_1_1_9 ;
    pa:condition "when relevant for connection or access to software that is critical for compliance" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.9" ;
    pa:quote "The machinery or related product shall collect evidence of a legitimate or illegitimate intervention in that hardware component, when relevant for connection or access to software that is critical for the compliance of the machinery or related product." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_collect_evidence_of_a_legitimate_or_illegitimate_interventio .

pa:st-0462 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_software_installed_on_it_1_1_9 ;
    pa:condition "intervention in the software or a modification of the software or its configuration" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.9" ;
    pa:quote "The machinery or related product shall collect evidence of a legitimate or illegitimate intervention in the software or a modification of the software installed on the machinery or related product or its configuration." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_collect_evidence_of_a_legitimate_or_illegitimate_interventio .

pa:st-0463 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_installed_software_1_1_9 ;
    pa:condition "software necessary for the machinery to operate safely" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.1.9" ;
    pa:quote "The machinery or related product shall identify the software installed on it that is necessary for it to operate safely, and shall be able to provide that information at all times in an easily accessible form." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_able_to_provide_that_information_at_all_times .

pa:st-0465 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:Document_tracing_log_of_data_generated_in_relation_to_an_intervention ;
    pa:condition "exclusively to demonstrate the conformity of the machinery or related product with this Annex further to a reasoned request from a competent national authority" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.1" ;
    pa:quote "(f) the tracing log of the data generated in relation to an intervention and of the versions of safety software uploaded after the machinery or related product has been placed on the market or put into service is enabled for five years after such upload, exclusively to demonstrate the conformity of the machinery or related product with this Annex further to a reasoned request from a competent national authority." ;
    pa:relation pa:retentionPeriod ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "P5Y"^^xsd:duration .

pa:st-0466 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:Document_recorded_data_on_the_safety_related_decision_making_process_ ;
    pa:condition "exclusively to demonstrate the conformity of the machinery or related product with this Annex further to a reasoned request from a competent national authority" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.1" ;
    pa:quote "(b) recording of data on the safety related decision-making process for software based safety systems ensuring safety function including safety components, after the machinery or related product has been placed on the market or put into service, is enabled and that such data is retained for one year after its collection, exclusively to demonstrate the conformity of the machinery or related product with this Annex further to a reasoned request from a competent national authority;" ;
    pa:relation pa:retentionPeriod ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "P1Y"^^xsd:duration .

pa:st-0467 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EconomicOperator_manufacturer ;
    pa:condition "where such modifications could lead to hazardous situations" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.1" ;
    pa:quote "(d) the limits of the safety functions are to be established as part of the risk assessment performed by the manufacturer and no modifications are allowed to the settings or rules generated by the machinery or related product or by operators, including during the machinery or related product learning phase, where such modifications could lead to hazardous situations;" ;
    pa:relation pa:hasObligation ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value "the limits of the safety functions are to be established as part of the risk assessment performed by the manufacturer" .

pa:st-0468 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_systems ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.1" ;
    pa:quote "Safety and reliability of control systems Control systems shall be designed and constructed in such a way as to prevent hazardous situations from arising." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_hazardous_situations .

pa:st-0469 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_modifications_to_the_settings_or_rules_of_control_systems ;
    pa:condition "where such modifications could lead to hazardous situations" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.1" ;
    pa:quote "(c) modifications to the settings or rules, generated by the machinery or related product or by operators, including during the machinery or related product learning phase, shall be prevented, where such modifications could lead to hazardous situations;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_shall_be_prevented .

pa:st-0471 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_system ;
    pa:condition "alternative to the operator being able to ensure no one is in the danger zones" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.2" ;
    pa:quote "From each control position, the operator shall be able to ensure that no one is in the danger zones, or the control system shall be designed and constructed in such a way that starting is prevented while someone is in the danger zone." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_starting_is_prevented_while_someone_is_in_the_danger_zone .

pa:st-0472 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_or_related_product_before_start ;
    pa:condition "if neither of these possibilities is applicable" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.2" ;
    pa:quote "If neither of these possibilities is applicable, before the machinery or related product starts, an acoustic and/or visual warning signal shall be given." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_an_acoustic_and_or_visual_warning_signal_shall_be_given .

pa:st-0473 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_or_related_products ;
    pa:condition "as required for safe operation" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.2" ;
    pa:quote "Machinery or related products shall be fitted with indicators as required for safe operation." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_fitted_with_indicators .

pa:st-0474 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_device_with_several_actions ;
    pa:condition "where no one-to-one correspondence and where necessary" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.2" ;
    pa:quote "Where a control device is designed and constructed to perform several different actions, namely, where there is no one-to-one correspondence, the action to be performed shall be clearly displayed and subject to confirmation, where necessary." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_subject_to_confirmation .

pa:st-0475 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_starting_machinery_or_related_product ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.3" ;
    pa:quote "Starting It shall be possible to start the machinery or related product only by voluntary actuation of a control device provided for the purpose." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_voluntary_actuation_of_a_control_device_provided_for_the_pur .

pa:st-0476 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_restarting_after_stoppage_or_change_in_operating_conditions ;
    pa:condition "on condition that this does not lead to a hazardous situation" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.3" ;
    pa:quote "However, the restarting of the machinery or related product or a change in operating conditions may be effected by voluntary actuation of a device other than the control device provided for the purpose, on condition that this does not lead to a hazardous situation." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_voluntary_actuation_of_a_device_other_than_the_control_devic .

pa:st-0477 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_several_starting_control_devices ;
    pa:condition "the operators can therefore put each other in danger" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.3" ;
    pa:quote "Where the machinery or related product has several starting control devices and the operators can therefore put each other in danger, additional devices shall be fitted to rule out such risks." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_additional_devices_shall_be_fitted_to_rule_out_such_risks .

pa:st-0478 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_starting_and_or_stopping_in_a_specific_sequence ;
    pa:condition "If safety requires that starting and/or stopping shall be performed in a specific sequence" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.3" ;
    pa:quote "If safety requires that starting and/or stopping shall be performed in a specific sequence, there shall be devices that ensure that these operations are performed in the correct order." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_devices_that_ensure_that_these_operations_are_performed_in_t .

pa:st-0479 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_starting_in_automatic_mode ;
    pa:condition "provided this does not lead to a hazardous situation" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.3" ;
    pa:quote "For the machinery or related product functioning in automatic mode, the starting of the machinery or related product, restarting after a stoppage, or a change in operating conditions may be possible without intervention, provided this does not lead to a hazardous situation." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_hazardous_situation .

pa:st-0481 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_normal_stop ;
    pa:condition "\"\"" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.1" ;
    pa:quote "Normal stop The machinery or related product shall be fitted with a control device whereby the machinery can be brought safely to a complete stop." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_control_device .

pa:st-0482 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_workstation_stop_control ;
    pa:condition "depending on the existing hazards" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.1" ;
    pa:quote "Each workstation shall be fitted with a control device to stop some or all of the functions of the machinery or related product, depending on the existing hazards, so that the machinery or related product is rendered safe." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_control_device .

pa:st-0483 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_stop_control_priority ;
    pa:condition "\"\"" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.1" ;
    pa:quote "The machinery or related product’s stop control shall have priority over the start controls." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_have_priority_over_the_start_controls .

pa:st-0485 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_operational_stop ;
    pa:condition "Where, for operational reasons, a stop control that does not cut off the energy supply to the actuators is required" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.2" ;
    pa:quote "Operational stop Where, for operational reasons, a stop control that does not cut off the energy supply to the actuators is required, the stop condition shall be monitored and maintained." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_stop_condition_shall_be_monitored_and_maintained .

pa:st-0486 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_or_related_product_emergency_stop ;
    pa:condition "The following exceptions apply" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.3" ;
    pa:quote "Emergency stop The machinery or related product shall be fitted with one or more emergency stop devices to enable actual or impending danger to be averted. The following exceptions apply:" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_one_or_more_emergency_stop_devices .

pa:st-0487 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_emergency_stop_device ;
    pa:condition "without creating additional risks" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.3" ;
    pa:quote "(b) stop the hazardous process as quickly as possible, without creating additional risks;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_stop_the_hazardous_process_as_quickly_as_possible .

pa:st-0488 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_emergency_stop_device_disengagement ;
    pa:condition "disengaging shall not restart the machinery but only permit restarting" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.3" ;
    pa:quote "it shall be possible to disengage the device only by an appropriate operation, and disengaging the device shall not restart the machinery or related product but only permit restarting." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_only_by_an_appropriate_operation .

pa:st-0490 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_1_2_4_4_assembly_of_machinery_or_related_products ;
    pa:condition "if its continued operation may be dangerous" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.4.4" ;
    pa:quote "Assembly of machinery or related products In the case of machinery or a related product or parts of machinery or a related product designed to work together, the machinery or a related product shall be designed and constructed in such a way that the stop controls, including the emergency stop devices, can stop not only the machinery or related product itself but also all related equipment, if its continued operation may be dangerous." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_stop_controls_including_the_emergency_stop_devices .

pa:st-0491 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_or_operating_mode_selector ;
    pa:condition "If the machinery or related product has been designed and constructed to allow its use in several control or operating modes requiring different protective measures and/or work procedures" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.5" ;
    pa:quote "If the machinery or related product has been designed and constructed to allow its use in several control or operating modes requiring different protective measures and/or work procedures, it shall be fitted with a mode selector, which can be locked in each position." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_mode_selector_which_can_be_locked_in_each_position .

pa:st-0492 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_or_operating_mode_selector ;
    pa:condition "The selector may be replaced" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.5" ;
    pa:quote "The selector may be replaced by another selection method, which restricts the use of certain functions of the machinery or related product to certain categories of operator." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_another_selection_method_which_restricts_the_use_of_certain_ .

pa:st-0493 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_or_operating_mode_selector ;
    pa:condition "If, for certain operations, the machinery or related product shall be able to operate with a guard displaced or removed and/or a protective device disabled" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.5" ;
    pa:quote "If, for certain operations, the machinery or related product shall be able to operate with a guard displaced or removed and/or a protective device disabled, the control or operating mode selector shall simultaneously: (a) disable all other control or operating modes; (b) permit operation of hazardous functions only by control devices requiring sustained action;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_permit_operation_of_hazardous_functions_only_by_control_devi .

pa:st-0494 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_control_or_operating_mode_selector ;
    pa:condition "If these four conditions cannot be fulfilled simultaneously" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.5" ;
    pa:quote "If these four conditions cannot be fulfilled simultaneously, the control or operating mode selector shall activate other protective measures designed and constructed to ensure a safe intervention zone." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_other_protective_measures_designed_and_constructed_to_ensure .

pa:st-0496 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_failure_of_the_power_supply_or_communication_network_connect ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.6" ;
    pa:quote "Failure of the power supply or communication network connection The interruption, the re-establishment after an interruption or the fluctuation in whatever manner of the power supply or communication network connection to the machinery or related product shall not lead to hazardous situations." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_hazardous_situations .

pa:st-0497 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_protective_devices ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.2.6" ;
    pa:quote "(f) the protective devices shall remain fully effective or give a stop command." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_the_protective_devices_shall_remain_fully_effective_or_give_ .

pa:st-0498 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_1 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.1" ;
    pa:quote "Risk of loss of stability The machinery or related product and its components and fittings shall be stable enough to avoid overturning, falling or uncontrolled movements during transportation, assembly, dismantling and any other action involving the machinery or related product." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risk_of_loss_of_stability .

pa:st-0499 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_1 ;
    pa:condition "If the shape of the machinery or related product itself or its intended installation does not offer sufficient stability" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.1" ;
    pa:quote "If the shape of the machinery or related product itself or its intended installation does not offer sufficient stability, appropriate means of anchorage shall be incorporated and indicated in the instructions for use." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_appropriate_means_of_anchorage .

pa:st-0500 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:Machinery_machinery_or_related_product ;
    pa:condition "If the shape of the machinery or related product itself or its intended installation does not offer sufficient stability" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.1" ;
    pa:quote "If the shape of the machinery or related product itself or its intended installation does not offer sufficient stability, appropriate means of anchorage shall be incorporated and indicated in the instructions for use." ;
    pa:relation pa:mustAccompany ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Document_instructions_for_use .

pa:st-0501 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_2 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.2" ;
    pa:quote "Risk of break-up during operation The various parts of machinery or related products and their linkages shall be able to withstand the stresses to which they are subject when used." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risk_of_break_up_during_operation .

pa:st-0502 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_parts_where_rupture_or_disintegration_risk_remains ;
    pa:condition "Where a risk of rupture or disintegration remains despite the measures taken" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.2" ;
    pa:quote "Where a risk of rupture or disintegration remains despite the measures taken, the parts concerned shall be mounted, positioned or guarded in such a way that any fragments will be contained, preventing hazardous situations." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_guarded_in_such_a_way_that_any_fragments_will_be_contained .

pa:st-0503 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_rigid_and_flexible_pipes_carrying_fluids ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.2" ;
    pa:quote "Both rigid and flexible pipes carrying fluids, particularly those under high pressure, shall be able to withstand the foreseen internal and external stresses and shall be firmly attached or protected to ensure that no risk is presented by a rupture." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_firmly_attached_or_protected .

pa:st-0504 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_machinery_with_material_fed_automatically_to_tool ;
    pa:condition "when the work piece comes into contact with the tool" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.2" ;
    pa:quote "(a) when the work piece comes into contact with the tool, the latter shall have attained its normal working condition;" ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_the_latter_shall_have_attained_its_normal_working_condition .

pa:st-0505 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_feed_movement_and_tool_movement_on_tool_start_or_stop ;
    pa:condition "when the tool starts and/or stops (intentionally or accidentally)" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.2" ;
    pa:quote "(b) when the tool starts and/or stops (intentionally or accidentally), the feed movement and the tool movement shall be coordinated." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_the_feed_movement_and_the_tool_movement_shall_be_coordinated .

pa:st-0507 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_3 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.3" ;
    pa:quote "Risks due to falling or ejected objects Precautions shall be taken to prevent risks from falling or ejected objects." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risks_due_to_falling_or_ejected_objects .

pa:st-0508 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_3 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.3" ;
    pa:quote "Risks due to falling or ejected objects Precautions shall be taken to prevent risks from falling or ejected objects." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_Precautions .

pa:st-0509 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_1_3_4_essential_requirement ;
    pa:condition "Insofar as their purpose allows" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.4" ;
    pa:quote "Risks due to surfaces, edges or angles Insofar as their purpose allows, accessible parts of the machinery or a related product shall have no sharp edges, no sharp angles and no rough surfaces likely to cause injury." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risks_due_to_surfaces_edges_or_angles .

pa:st-0510 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_1_3_4_essential_requirement ;
    pa:condition "Insofar as their purpose allows" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.4" ;
    pa:quote "Risks due to surfaces, edges or angles Insofar as their purpose allows, accessible parts of the machinery or a related product shall have no sharp edges, no sharp angles and no rough surfaces likely to cause injury." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_no_sharp_edges_no_sharp_angles_and_no_rough_surfaces .

pa:st-0511 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_combined_machinery_or_related_product ;
    pa:condition "Where the machinery or related product is intended to carry out several different operations with manual removal of the piece between each operation" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.5" ;
    pa:quote "Risks related to a combined machinery or related product Where the machinery or related product is intended to carry out several different operations with manual removal of the piece between each operation (combined machinery or related product), it shall be designed and constructed in such a way as to enable each element to be used separately without the other elements constituting a risk for exposed persons." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risks_related_to_a_combined_machinery_or_related_product .

pa:st-0512 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_elements_of_combined_machinery ;
    pa:condition "any elements that are not protected" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.5" ;
    pa:quote "For this purpose, it shall be possible to start and stop separately any elements that are not protected." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_start_and_stop_separately .

pa:st-0514 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_6 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.6" ;
    pa:quote "Risks related to variations in operating conditions Where the machinery or related product performs operations under different conditions of use, it shall be designed and constructed in such a way that selection and adjustment of these conditions can be carried out safely and reliably." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risks_related_to_variations_in_operating_conditions .

pa:st-0515 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_6 ;
    pa:condition "Where the machinery or related product performs operations under different conditions of use" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.6" ;
    pa:quote "Risks related to variations in operating conditions Where the machinery or related product performs operations under different conditions of use, it shall be designed and constructed in such a way that selection and adjustment of these conditions can be carried out safely and reliably." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_designed_and_constructed_in_such_a_way .

pa:st-0516 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_essential_requirement_1_3_7 ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.7" ;
    pa:quote "Risks related to moving parts The moving parts of the machinery or related product shall be designed and constructed in such a way as to prevent risks of contact which could lead to accidents or shall, where risks persist, be fitted with guards or protective devices." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_Risks_related_to_moving_parts .

pa:st-0517 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_1_3_7_moving_parts ;
    pa:condition "where risks persist" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.7" ;
    pa:quote "Risks related to moving parts The moving parts of the machinery or related product shall be designed and constructed in such a way as to prevent risks of contact which could lead to accidents or shall, where risks persist, be fitted with guards or protective devices." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_guards_or_protective_devices .

pa:st-0518 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_prevention_of_accidental_blockage_of_moving_parts ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.7" ;
    pa:quote "All necessary steps shall be taken to prevent accidental blockage of moving parts." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_All_necessary_steps .

pa:st-0519 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_blockage_of_moving_parts ;
    pa:condition "In cases where, despite the precautions taken, a blockage is likely to occur" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.7" ;
    pa:quote "In cases where, despite the precautions taken, a blockage is likely to occur, the necessary specific protective devices and tools shall, when appropriate, be provided to enable the equipment to be safely unblocked." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_specific_protective_devices_and_tools .

pa:st-0521 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_1_3_8_choice_of_protection_against_moving_parts ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.8" ;
    pa:quote "Choice of protection against risks arising from moving parts Guards or protective devices designed to protect against risks arising from moving parts shall be selected on the basis of the type of risk." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_Guards_or_protective_devices .

pa:st-0522 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_1_3_8_choice_of_protection_against_moving_parts ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.8" ;
    pa:quote "Choice of protection against risks arising from moving parts Guards or protective devices designed to protect against risks arising from moving parts shall be selected on the basis of the type of risk." ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:Risk_risks_arising_from_moving_parts .

pa:st-0524 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_guards_for_moving_transmission_parts ;
    pa:condition "either fixed guards or interlocking movable guards" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.8.1" ;
    pa:quote "Moving transmission parts Guards designed to protect persons against the hazards generated by moving transmission parts shall be: (a) either fixed guards as referred to in section 1.4.2.1; or (b) interlocking movable guards as referred to in section 1.4.2.2." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_fixed_guards .

pa:st-0525 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_guards_for_moving_transmission_parts ;
    pa:condition "either fixed guards or interlocking movable guards" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.8.1" ;
    pa:quote "or (b) interlocking movable guards as referred to in section 1.4.2.2." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_interlocking_movable_guards .

pa:st-0526 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_guards_for_moving_transmission_parts ;
    pa:condition "where frequent access is envisaged" ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.8.1" ;
    pa:quote "Interlocking movable guards shall be used where frequent access is envisaged." ;
    pa:relation pa:requiresMeasure ;
    pa:sourceDocument "REG" ;
    pa:value pa:ProtectiveMeasure_Interlocking_movable_guards_shall_be_used .

pa:st-0527 a pa:Statement ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo "strategy_b" ;
    pa:about pa:EssentialRequirement_guards_for_moving_transmission_parts ;
    pa:locator "Annex III, 1.3.8.1" ;
    pa:quote "Moving transmission parts Guards designed to protect persons against the hazards generated by moving transmission parts shall be:" ;
    pa:relation pa:addressesRisk ;
